Add or update one resource's login, client and connector

Usage:
  mcp-runtime cluster mcp-auth resource apply [flags]

Flags:
      --context string      Explicit Kubernetes context
      --dry-run             Validate and show whether MCP Auth would change, without writing
      --file string         Resource file, YAML or JSON (no secrets: the connector names its client secret variable)
  -h, --help                help for apply
      --kubeconfig string   Explicit kubeconfig path
      --yes                 Apply the change without an interactive prompt

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging
